{"id":"1d0b2b70d1c22cc7","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-well-order.md","title":"Well-Order","display":"df-well-order — Well-Order","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-well-order","aliases":["58-df-well-order"],"display":"df-well-order — Well-Order","depends_on":["[[58-df-total-order]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-well-order"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-well-order</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-well-order — Well-Order"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"043908345fb04de3\" href=\"?note=043908345fb04de3\" title=\"58-df-total-order\">58-df-total-order</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,R\\in V\">\\(X,R\\in V\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq X\\times X\">\\(R\\subseteq X\\times X\\)</span> (carrier and binary relation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TotalOrder}(X,R)\">\\(\\operatorname{TotalOrder}(X,R)\\)</span> (total-order predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"043908345fb04de3\" href=\"?note=043908345fb04de3\" title=\"58-df-total-order\">58-df-total-order</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WellOrder}(X,R)\">\\(\\operatorname{WellOrder}(X,R)\\)</span> (well-order predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}well\\text{-}order}\\vdash \\operatorname{WellOrder}(X,R)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TotalOrder}(X,R)\\land\\forall Y\\subseteq X\\;\\Bigl(Y\\neq\\varnothing\\to\\exists y\\in Y\\;\\forall z\\in Y\\;(y=z\\lor\\langle y,z\\rangle\\in R)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}well\\text{-}order}\\vdash \\operatorname{WellOrder}(X,R)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TotalOrder}(X,R)\\land\\forall Y\\subseteq X\\;\\Bigl(Y\\neq\\varnothing\\to\\exists y\\in Y\\;\\forall z\\in Y\\;(y=z\\lor\\langle y,z\\rangle\\in R)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Well-orders have no infinite descending chains.</li>\n<li>Every set can be well-ordered by AC.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-total-order","status":"resolved","id":"043908345fb04de3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-total-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-total-order","status":"resolved","id":"043908345fb04de3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TotalOrder}(X,R)$ (total-order predicate, see [[58-df-total-order]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,R\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq X\\times X","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TotalOrder}(X,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{WellOrder}(X,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}well\\text{-}order}\\vdash \\operatorname{WellOrder}(X,R)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TotalOrder}(X,R)\\land\\forall Y\\subseteq X\\;\\Bigl(Y\\neq\\varnothing\\to\\exists y\\in Y\\;\\forall z\\in Y\\;(y=z\\lor\\langle y,z\\rangle\\in R)\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":839,"backlinks":[{"id":"54516e12661b931e","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{WellOrder}$ (well-order predicate, see [[../batch20/58-df-well-order.md]])"},{"i